# DustPHREEQCFeedback regression test — Phase 21 PHREEQC deposition feedback.
#
# Tests write_phreeqc_deposition_file and append_phreeqc_site_summary.
# max_step=7, phreeqc_feedback_interval_s=1.0s (dt=0.5s -> writes at t=1,2,3 s).
# Final step t=3.5s: write triggered by is_final=true and nstep>last_write_step.
#
# ERF write timing: write_output() called from WriteAtIntermediateTime and
# WriteAtFinalTime in Source/ERF.cpp (same as Phase 16 pattern).
#
# Two mine sites (from Phase 20 pattern):
#   site 1 "mine_north": j=4..7 (32 cells, y=[1500,3000])
#   site 2 "mine_south": j=0..3 (32 cells, y=[0,1500])
#
# Expected results:
#   (1) [DUST DEBUG] Phase 21 printed at init with correct params.
#   (2) [DUST DEBUG] Phase 21 PHREEQC feedback written at steps 2,4,6,7
#       (t=1.0, 2.0, 3.0 s from interval=1.0 s; step 7 from is_final).
#   (3) dust_dep_feedback.dat exists after run; contains header + 64 rows
#       (8x8 dust grid, ni=8, nj=8).
#   (4) dust_dep_feedback.dat header shows final step/time.
#       File is overwritten each interval so only final state is retained.
#   (5) dust_dep_site_summary.csv exists; contains header + rows for each
#       write event (4 writes * 3 rows each = 12 data rows:
#       site 0=unassigned, site 1=mine_north, site 2=mine_south).
#   (6) dust_dep_site_summary.csv total_deposition_kg >= 0 for all rows.
#   (7) site 1 + site 2 total_deposition_kg + site 0 total =
#       domain total deposition (mass conservation check).
#   (8) With phreeqc_feedback_interval_s=0: no feedback files written
#       except at final step (is_final guard active).
#   (9) Run exits code 0.
#
# File format note: dust_dep_feedback.dat is whitespace-delimited with
# 3 columns (x_centre_m, y_centre_m, deposition_kg_m2) for use as input
# to a PHREEQC batch script that maps deposition loading to
# surface chemistry updates.
# Reference: Parkhurst & Appelo (2013). https://pubs.usgs.gov/tm/06/a43/
#
# References:
#   Parkhurst & Appelo (2013). PHREEQC Version 3.
#     https://pubs.usgs.gov/tm/06/a43/
#   Marticorena & Bergametti (1995). J. Geophys. Res., 100, 16415.
#     https://doi.org/10.1029/95JD00690
#   Shao & Lu (2000). J. Geophys. Res., 105, 22437.
#     https://doi.org/10.1029/2000JD900304
#   ERF_FirePrerequisites.H (periodic write pattern):
#     https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/f264ce7dd0f5e727c71c939659a6a5caf001d21b/
#     Source/Fire/ERF_FirePrerequisites.H
#   ERF_FireStatsOutput.H (append CSV pattern):
#     https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/f264ce7dd0f5e727c71c939659a6a5caf001d21b/
#     Source/Fire/ERF_FireStatsOutput.H

